OL,3,GNEWSAMan drugged and then abused
OL,4,Asleeping girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut his abuse of his girlfriend was
OL,7,Fdiscovered after he sent WhatsApp
OL,8,Fmessages to a sex worker saying that
OL,9,Fhis "kink" was "sexually abusing his
OL,10,Fgirlfriend's sister while she was
OL,11,Fasleep".
OL,13,FAt Nottingham Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,14,Fhe was sentenced to 12 years in prison.
